OL,3,GNEWSAMass city youth disorder prompts
OL,4,Aparenting plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gathering of more than 100 youths in
OL,7,Fa city centre prompted a plea from
OL,8,Fpolice who said most parents they
OL,9,Fcontact about anti-social behaviour
OL,10,F"are unaware of the disorder their
OL,11,Fchildren are causing".
OL,13,FGroups appeared around Carlisle on
OL,14,FSaturday night where there were reports
OL,15,Fof stones and eggs being thrown, verbal
OL,16,Fabuse, intimidating behaviour, racially
OL,17,Fmotivated harassment, fighting and
OL,18,Fdrunken disorder.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
