OL,3,GNEWSAMass city youth disorder prompts
OL,4,Aparenting plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne teenager was arrested for multiple
OL,7,Foffences and another five have been
OL,8,Finterviewed, with a further four
OL,9,Finterviews planned, Cumbria Police
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FIn a message to families, the force
OL,13,Fsaid: "Parents, do you know where your
OL,14,Fchildren are, who they are associating
OL,15,Fwith, what they are doing?"
